# Cloudflare Pages redirects (GitHub Pages ignores this file).
# www -> apex is NOT here: Pages _redirects only accepts relative paths and skips
# "https://www.birdiebuddy.io/* https://birdiebuddy.io/:splat 301" as invalid.
# It lives in the zone instead: Rules > Redirect Rules, "Redirect from WWW to root" template
# (hostname eq www.birdiebuddy.io -> https://birdiebuddy.io${path}, 301, preserve query string).

# Round 2 (10/30): the NFL Overview page was folded into the NFL home.
/nfl/overview /nfl/ 301
/nfl/overview/* /nfl/ 301
